# Legacy RTILA/Apps Script artifacts. Kept on disk as reference for the M1
# importer, but deliberately not committed: they embed a live RTILA license key,
# a customer email, and an unauthenticated Apps Script /exec URL that grants
# read/write access to the source spreadsheet. Git history is hard to scrub.
# Force-add individual files with `git add -f` if you decide otherwise.
